      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">Carrollton's 1970s to 1990s subdivisions are full of aging wood fences, alley gates and shared lines. Call now and ask for two or three comparable written quotes from independent fence contractors.</p>
